---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import HeroTree from '../components/HeroTree.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Dr. Ramesh Kayyam" description="Learn about Dr. Ramesh Kayyam, author, leadership scholar, speaker, and educator.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">About Talkintree</p><h1>Curiosity is the beginning of every meaningful journey.</h1><p>Dr. Ramesh Kayyam is an author, leadership scholar, speaker, and lifelong learner exploring the meeting place of humanity, technology, education, and story.</p></div><HeroTree compact/></div></section>
<section class="paper section"><div class="container narrative"><p class="eyebrow">The story behind the work</p><h2 class="section-title">Knowledge should help us become more human—not less.</h2><div><p>Talkintree is the creative and intellectual home of Dr. Ramesh Kayyam. His work brings academic insight and lived experience into conversation with questions that matter: How should we lead? What does technology ask of us? How do stories help us understand one another?</p><p>Across books, speaking, research, and educational work, Dr. Kayyam invites people to face change with wisdom, courage, and a deep regard for human potential.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">What guides the work</p><div class="values"><article><b>01</b><h3>Humanity</h3><p>Progress is valuable when it honors dignity, connection, and purpose.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Curiosity</h3><p>Questions are the roots of learning, innovation, and imagination.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Leadership</h3><p>Leadership is the practice of helping people move toward a better future.</p></article></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.page-hero{padding:10.5rem 0 4rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 38%,#253f30,#111 53%)}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;align-items:center}.split h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,5.5rem);letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:1rem 0}.split p:not(.eyebrow){color:#d1cbc0;max-width:580px;font-size:1.08rem}.narrative{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6rem}.narrative>div p{color:#58534b;font-size:1.05rem}.values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);margin-top:3rem}.values article{padding:1.7rem;border:1px solid rgba(214,181,107,.3)}.values b{color:var(--gold);font-size:.7rem}.values h3{font-size:1.7rem;margin:1.7rem 0 .5rem}.values p{color:#b7afa4}@media(max-width:750px){.split,.narrative,.values{grid-template-columns:1fr}.split :global(.tree-scene){display:none}.narrative{gap:2rem}}</style>
